{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Repair lifecycle",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "description": "M05 backend. SUBMITTED maps new. Half-finished resource requests visibly remain pending and retry after process/lease recovery. Persistent exact original effectiveAt string is broadcast only after real b receipt to both /internal/reservations/maintenance-events and /internal/approvals/maintenance-events with source highwater; 404/503 retain pending tasks. No cross-domain DB writes. Overdue >=first dueAt escalates once to effective repair:assign recipients, without reassignment. Email only from current enabled+verified identity; in-app is bilingual. Public source/settings URLs derive existing workflow identity resource origin; same service HTTP defaults loopback8081. All external calls outside DB transactions. Existing V1/9-test evaluation history preserved; evaluation text0..500 chars, integer rating1..5, no self evaluation."
  },
